<dialog id="security-block-create-dialog" class="security-modal security-block-modal" data-block-create-dialog aria-labelledby="security-block-create-title">
  <div class="security-modal-card">
    <header class="security-modal-header">
      <div>
        <h3 id="security-block-create-title">Crear bloqueo privado</h3>
      </div>
      <button class="modal-close" type="button" data-modal-close aria-label="Cerrar dialogo"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
    </header>
    <form class="lifecycle-form security-modal-form" method="POST" action={sectionHref('customers')} data-block-create-form>
      <div class="security-modal-body">
        <p>El bloqueo aplicara las senales privadas seleccionadas. Las direcciones se usan solo para avisar sobre pedidos nuevos que necesitan revision; no bloquean ni cancelan automaticamente.</p>
        <input type="hidden" name="section" value="customers" />
        <input type="hidden" name="customer" value="" data-block-create-customer />
        <input type="hidden" name="security_action" value="security_block_create" />
        <label class="field" for="security-block-scope">
          <span>Alcance</span>
          <select id="security-block-scope" name="block_scope" required data-block-scope-select data-dialog-focus>
            {blockScopeCreateOptions.map(([value]) => <option value={value}>{BLOCK_SCOPE_ACTION_LABELS[value]}</option>)}
          </select>
        </label>
        <label class="field" for="security-block-duration">
          <span>Duracion</span>
          <select id="security-block-duration" name="block_duration" required data-block-duration-select>
            {blockDurationOptions.map(([value, label]) => <option value={value}>{label}</option>)}
          </select>
        </label>
        <fieldset class="signal-fieldset">
          <legend>Senales privadas</legend>
          <div class="signal-grid">
            <label class="signal-option" for="security-block-match-phone">
              <input id="security-block-match-phone" type="checkbox" name="match_phone" data-signal-checkbox="phone" />
              <span>
                <strong>Telefono</strong>
                <small data-signal-count="phone">0 disponibles</small>
              </span>
            </label>
            <label class="signal-option" for="security-block-match-device">
              <input id="security-block-match-device" type="checkbox" name="match_device" data-signal-checkbox="device" />
              <span>
                <strong>Dispositivo</strong>
                <small data-signal-count="device">0 disponibles</small>
              </span>
            </label>
            <label class="signal-option" for="security-block-match-ip">
              <input id="security-block-match-ip" type="checkbox" name="match_ip" data-signal-checkbox="ip" />
              <span>
                <strong>IP</strong>
                <small data-signal-count="ip">0 disponibles</small>
              </span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <label class="field" for="security-block-match-mode">
          <span>Coincidencia</span>
          <select id="security-block-match-mode" name="match_mode" required data-block-match-mode>
            <option value="any">Cualquier senal seleccionada</option>
            <option value="all">Todas las senales seleccionadas</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <p class="modal-warning" data-ip-warning hidden>La IP debe usarse con otra senal cuando sea posible. Es una senal volatil y privada.</p>
        <fieldset class="signal-fieldset address-watch-fieldset">
          <legend>Direcciones para alertas</legend>
          {addressCandidates.length > 0 ? (
            <>
              <div class="address-watch-head">
                <p>Selecciona una, varias o todas. La mas reciente aparece marcada inicialmente.</p>
                <button class="secondary-action address-select-all" type="button" data-address-select-all>Seleccionar todas</button>
              </div>
              <div class="address-watch-list">
                {addressCandidates.map((candidate) => (
                  <label class="address-watch-option">
                    <input
                      type="checkbox"
                      name="block_address_order_ids"
                      value={candidate.order_id}
                      checked={candidate.preselected}
                      data-address-checkbox
                    />
                    <span>
                      <strong>{candidate.address_display}</strong>
                      <small>{candidate.municipality_display} · usada {formatNumber(candidate.uses_count)} {candidate.uses_count === 1 ? 'vez' : 'veces'} · ultima vez {formatDateTime(candidate.last_used_at)}</small>
                    </span>
                  </label>
                ))}
              </div>
              <p class="modal-warning">Una direccion puede ser compartida. Si vuelve a aparecer, el pedido entrara normalmente y Seguridad avisara al administrador para revisarlo.</p>
            </>
          ) : (
            <p>No hay direcciones de entrega validas en el historial de este cliente. El bloqueo puede crearse sin esta alerta adicional.</p>
          )}
        </fieldset>
        <label class="field" for="security-block-reason">
          <span>Motivo interno</span>
          <textarea id="security-block-reason" name="block_reason" maxlength="500" required></textarea>
        </label>
      </div>
      <footer class="security-modal-footer">
        <button class="secondary-action" type="button" data-modal-cancel>Cancelar</button>
        <button class="danger-action" type="submit">Crear bloqueo</button>
      </footer>
    </form>
  </div>
</dialog>

